@startuml
actor User
participant UI
participant Application
participant RevitLayer as "Revit layer"
participant Revit as "Autodesk Revit"
participant Domain

User -> UI : Open filter / choose scope
UI -> Application : CollectContext
Application -> RevitLayer : request collection
RevitLayer -> Revit : collect elements
Revit --> RevitLayer : ids / parameters / host context
RevitLayer --> Application : records / snapshots
Application -> Domain : build semantic representations
Application --> UI : tree / parameters / values

User -> UI : choose conditions
UI -> Application : BuildQuickFilter / Evaluate
Application -> Domain : FilterDefinition + snapshots
Domain --> Application : semantic models
Application --> UI : FilterResult

User -> UI : Select / Hide / Isolate / Native Filter
UI -> Application : action request
Application -> RevitLayer : resolved action set
RevitLayer -> Revit : ExternalEvent / transaction if required
Revit --> RevitLayer : action result
RevitLayer --> UI : feedback
@enduml
